The {{Zone|Regalia Room}} is a [[Location]] under the [[Auction House]], where certain items can be bought. It can only be accessed if the player has {{Item|Shen's Regalia}}.

== Purpose ==
There are {{Green|3}} items located in the '''Regalia Room''', which can be purchased for {{C}}. The first two items are always present, while the third one rotates every [[SkyBlock Year]]. The third item is the same for all players.

Players can only purchase {{Green|4}} {{Item|Enchanted Book|text=Divine Gift Books}} and {{Green|4}} {{Item|The Art of Peace|text=Arts of Peace}} per day, the daily limit resets at midnight {{confirm}} Eastern Time. There is no limit on the special item.

